Automation: Weekly Review Summary (Task 9)
Goal: Every Sunday, automatically generate a summary of the week's completed tasks.
Option A — Zapier (free tier)
Trigger: Schedule by Zapier — every Sunday 18:00 (IST, set your timezone).
Action: Notion → Find Database Items — Tasks database, filter Status = Done and Due in last 7 days.
Action: ChatGPT / Claude (via Zapier) — prompt below with the task list inserted.
Action: Notion → Create Database Item in the Weekly Review page with the output.
Prompt used in step 3
You are helping a college student review their week.
Here are the tasks completed this week:
{{task_list}}

Write:
1. A 3-line summary of what was done.
2. The top 2 things that went well.
3. One task to carry over to next week.
Do not invent tasks that are not in the list.
Option B — Manual fallback
If the free automation limit is reached, run the same prompt by hand in Claude every Sunday and paste the result into the Weekly Review page.
